    "details": "<p><strong>About Bug Bounty </strong></p>\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">Get ready for an exciting Bug Bounty where participants solve hands-on security challenges by identifying vulnerabilities and capturing flags</span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\">. Inspired by challenge-based Capture-the-Flag (CTF) formats, the event features real-world scenarios with varying difficulty levels and a competitive leaderboard to test participants' cybersecurity skills</span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\">.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Key Highlights</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,0\">Challenge-based Bug Bounty / CTF competition</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,0\">Real-world security scenarios with varying difficulty levels</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,0\">Dynamic live leaderboard for participant rankings</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,0\">Focus on ethical hacking, web exploits, and responsible vulnerability discovery</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0,2\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0,0\">Team size: Maximum 2 members</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\">Participants may attack only the event application</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\">Attacks against college infrastructure, other teams, or the event platform are strictly prohibited</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\">Do not perform Denial-of-Service (DoS/DDoS) attacks</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\">No sharing of flags, exploits, or solutions with other teams</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\">Automated exploitation tools are permitted unless restricted for a specific challenge</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,0\">Any form of malpractice will result in immediate disqualification</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,6,0,2\">.</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"9,7,0,0\">The judges' decision is final and binding</span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,7,0,2\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Details</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\n<li>Date: 8th October 2026</li>\n<li>Timings: 10:00 AM &ndash; 2:00 PM IST</li>\n<li>Venue: BMS 7th Floor Lab, SRM IST, Ramapuram, Chennai</li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0,0\">Team Size: 1 &ndash; 2 Members</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"11,6,0,0\">Registration Fee: ₹200 per team</span></li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"11,7,0,0\">Prize Pool: ₹3,000 Cash Pool&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>",
